  "details": "I can get nested pretty heavily in Action Menus, especially with the new items, tools, and such. I'd like to have a button that puts me to the top of the menu (where the Tools, Expressions, etc are), from any depth.\n\nNice to have would be a setting (per hand) to do that automatically. This for me is because I tend to have one hand for items, stickers, and emoji, and I want that hand to reset, and I use the other for avatar toggles and gogoloco, which I want to stay where it is so I can quickly toggle things back off.",
